{"book":"hono","chapter":"middleware-builtin","chapterTitle":"الوسائط المدمجة","slug":"mount","title":"تركيب البرمجية الوسيطة","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام","text":"الاستخدام"},{"depth":2,"id":"الخيارات","text":"الخيارات"},{"depth":3,"id":"optionhandler-c-context-gt-unknown","text":"optionHandler: (c: Context) =&gt; unknown"},{"depth":3,"id":"replacerequest-originalrequest-request-gt-request-false","text":"replaceRequest: ((originalRequest: Request) =&gt; Request) | false"}],"html":"<p>تتيح لك وسيطة التركيب (Mount Middleware) تركيب تطبيق مبني بإطار عمل آخر داخل تطبيق Hono الخاص بك.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { mount } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/mount&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام\">الاستخدام</h2>\n<p>سجّل الوسيط بـ <code>app.all()</code> على مسار ينتهي بـ <code>/*</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Router</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IttyRouter</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;itty-router&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Create itty-router application</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> ittyRouter = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IttyRouter</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Handle `GET /itty-router/hello`</span>\nittyRouter.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Response</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello from itty-router&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/itty-router/*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">mount</span>(ittyRouter.<span class=\"hljs-property\">handle</span>))\n</code></pre>\n<p>افتراضيًا، يستقبل التطبيق المُثبَّت <code>Request</code> مع إزالة بادئة المسار المطابقة (path prefix) من عنوان URL الخاص به. الطلب إلى <code>/itty-router/hello</code> يصل إلى itty-router كـ <code>/hello</code>.</p>\n<p>يُستدعى التطبيق المُثبَّت (mounted) كـ <code>handler(request, c.env, c.executionCtx)</code>، نفس وسائط Cloudflare Workers <code>fetch</code> المعالج. استخدم <code>optionHandler</code> لتمرير وسائط مختلفة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"الخيارات\">الخيارات</h2>\n<p>يمكنك تمرير دالة أو كائن (object) كوسيط ثانٍ.</p>\n<h3 id=\"optionhandler-c-context-gt-unknown\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> <code>optionHandler</code>: <code>(c: Context) =&gt; unknown</code></h3>\n<p>يعيد الوسائط (arguments) الممرَّرة إلى التطبيق المُثبَّت (mounted) بعد <code>Request</code>. يتم توسيع المصفوفة إلى عدة وسائط. يمكنك تمرير الدالة مباشرة كوسيطة ثانية:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { mount } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/mount&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">anotherApp</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">request</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Request</span>, ...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span>[]</span>) =&gt;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Response</span>(request.<span class=\"hljs-property\">url</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Call `anotherApp(request, c.env)`</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/app/*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">mount</span>(anotherApp, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>)\n)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Call `anotherApp(request, c.env, c.executionCtx)`</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/app/*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">mount</span>(anotherApp, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">optionHandler</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> [c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>, c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">executionCtx</span>],\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"replacerequest-originalrequest-request-gt-request-false\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> replaceRequest: <code>((originalRequest: Request) =&gt; Request) | false</code></h3>\n<p>يتحكم في أي <code>Request</code> يُمرَّر إلى التطبيق المُثبَّت:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { mount } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/mount&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">anotherApp</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">request</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Request</span>, ...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span>[]</span>) =&gt;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Response</span>(request.<span class=\"hljs-property\">url</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// `/legacy/users` reaches the mounted application as `/api/users`</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/legacy/*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">mount</span>(anotherApp, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">replaceRequest</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">req</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> url = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">URL</span>(req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">url</span>)\n      url.<span class=\"hljs-property\">pathname</span> = url.<span class=\"hljs-property\">pathname</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replace</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/^\\/legacy/</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api&#x27;</span>)\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Request</span>(url, req)\n    },\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n<p>لتمرير الأصلي <code>Request</code> دون تغيير، اضبطه على <code>false</code> كاختصار لـ <code>(req) =&gt; req</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { mount } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/mount&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">anotherApp</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">request</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Request</span>, ...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span>[]</span>) =&gt;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Response</span>(request.<span class=\"hljs-property\">url</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/app/*&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">mount</span>(anotherApp, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">replaceRequest</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>,\n  })\n)\n</code></pre>\n"}